@startuml UC21_SSD
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title UC21: System Sequence Diagram - Submit Event Content Report

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : clickReportEvent(eventID)
System --> User : displayReportModal()
User -> System : submitReport(eventID, reason, details)
System -> System : saveReportRecord(eventID, reason, details)
System --> User : showReportConfirmationToast()
@enduml
